<title>GERMANY: Tarkett Q1 net profit down 22.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Tarkett Q1 net profit down 22.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKENTHAL, Germany 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   10.6    vs 13.7</p>
<p>Earnings before writedowns for goodwill</p>
<p>    and before financial income	    28.5    vs 31.2</p>
<p>    Sales					  359.1   up 8.3 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German floor coverings manufacturer is Tarkett AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
